  "body": "Imagine waking up just moments from the beautiful waters of Waiake Beach.\r\n\r\nThis brand-new, standalone freehold home has been thoughtfully designed for easy, modern coastal living. Quality materials, stylish finishes and a focus on comfort and longevity make this an inviting choice for families, upsizers or astute investors.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned between Browns Bay and Torbay, you’ll have the best of the East Coast Bays lifestyle on your doorstep: morning swims, paddleboarding and relaxing coastal walks, all just moments from home.\r\n\r\nLot 5 at a Glance: \r\n• Land Area:  approx.159.6m² \r\n• Floor Area:  approx.177m² \r\n• 4 Bedrooms \r\n• 2.5 Bathrooms \r\n• Single Garage \r\n• Brand-New Construction \r\n• Standalone Freehold Residence \r\n• Fully Fenced \r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure this beautiful home just moments from Waiake Beach. With thoughtful design and a privileged coastal location, Lot 5 offers the perfect balance of modern sophistication and relaxed seaside living.",
